    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεωτερ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>attempt to change</i>;
			esp. in bad sense, <i>innovation, revolutionary movement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				422a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				555d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				17.15
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				758c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφορος ἐπὶ τῶν ν.,</span>
			title of official at Sparta, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BSA</u>
				27.234
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally, <i>change,</i> as of diet, Sabin. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).562
			</span></i>.</div>
